   "subject": "poppr 2.0.1 released on CRAN",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello everyone,<div><br></div><div>Poppr version 2.0.1 has just been released on CRAN and is available for all systems. This version fixes a major bug when importing diploid data with genalex that contained missing data. Details are here: <a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480916205000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2-lwzxOEFiQP--m8gfybpr\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.1</a></div><div><br></div><div>You can find details about version 2 here: <a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480916205000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3TOy-PrEmR5dk5tNkaKEBL\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.0</a></div><div><br></div><div>To install from CRAN, you may type:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;poppr&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480916205000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0DAx2DzDZGPiPOJvaMRrCX\">http://cran.rstudio.com</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Zhian</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "uurbwU_zl-QJ",
   "from": "Zhian Kamvar",
   "author": "d192ec4b1d416345",
   "date": "2015-07-17T23:16:54Z",
   "subject": "Re: poppr 2.0.1 released on CRAN",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<div><br></div><div>It appears there is a small numerical bug in the calculation of Hexp (from the functions poppr and locus_table). I cannot upload a new version to CRAN for another couple of weeks, so until then please use the following code every time you load poppr:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">devtools</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">source_gist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;b64078a0d04d2452c905&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>You can also download the code from here: <a href=\"https://gist.github.com/zkamvar/b64078a0d04d2452c905\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://gist.github.com/zkamvar/b64078a0d04d2452c905&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480916207000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0mPLNf_iT0FvkN4Ul_UKLP\">https://gist.github.com/zkamvar/b64078a0d04d2452c905</a></div><div><br></div><div>If you have a C compiler on your computer, you may also install directly from GitHub:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">devtools</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">install_github</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;grunwaldlab/poppr&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>Details on the change can be found here: <a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/issues/47\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/issues/47&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480916207000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ppPY5EIecMrf1UUJM3FWq\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/issues/47</a></div><div><br></div><div>Sorry for the inconvenience,</div><div>Zhian</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Wednesday, July 15, 2015 at 11:10:09 AM UTC-7, Zhian Kamvar wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello everyone,<div><br></div><div>Poppr version 2.0.1 has just been released on CRAN and is available for all systems. This version fixes a major bug when importing diploid data with genalex that contained missing data. Details are here: <a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.1\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480916207000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ujiGqOL3JoQAbG7gukykv\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.1</a></div><div><br></div><div>You can find details about version 2 here: <a href=\"https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480916207000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1H3_8fNTf5Fq2vqXsJ4kgS\">https://github.com/grunwaldlab/poppr/releases/tag/v.2.0.0</a></div><div><br></div><div>To install from CRAN, you may type:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;poppr&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;<a href=\"http://cran.rstudio.com\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.rstudio.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792480916208000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0rPMfOQMhXFwIQ19JP86Vg\">http://cran.rstudio.com</a>&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Zhian</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
